          %p Apart from attaching a set of cells all at once to a fixed base space, we may “attach cells to cells” in that after forming a given cell attachment, then we further attach cells to the resulting attaching space, and ever so on:
          #RelativeCellComplexes.num_defn
            %h6#definition_5 Definition
            %p
