            %p
              A
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+CW-complex"} finite CW-complex
              is one which admits a presentation in which there are only finitely many attaching maps, and similarly a
              %em countable CW-complex
              is one which admits a presentation with countably many attaching maps.
            %p
              Given a CW-complex, then
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
