          %h2#references References
          %p The introduction of the term is contained in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J.+H.+C.+Whitehead"}> J. H. C. Whitehead
              ,
              %em Combinatorial homotopy I
              , Bull. Amer. Math. Soc, 55, (1949), 213–245.
          %p Basic textbook accounts:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Brayton Gray,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Homotopy Theory: An Introduction to Algebraic Topology
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/George+Whitehead"}> George Whitehead
                , chapter II of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Elements of homotopy theory
            %li#Bredon93
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Glen+Bredon"}> Glen Bredon
                , Section IV.8-9 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topology and Geometry
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 139
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4757-6848-0"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4757-6848-0
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://virtualmath1.stanford.edu/~ralph/math215b/Bredon.pdf"} pdf
            %li#May
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+May"}> Peter May
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Concise+Course+in+Algebraic+Topology"} A Concise Course in Algebraic Topology
            %li#Hatcher02
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Allen+Hatcher"}> Allen Hatcher
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Algebraic Topology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.cambridge.org/gb/academic/subjects/mathematics/geometry-and-topology/algebraic-topology-1?format=PB&isbn=9780521795401"} ISBN:9780521795401
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://pi.math.cornell.edu/~hatcher/AT/ATpage.html"} webpage
            %li#HatcherTopologyOfCellComplexes
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Allen+Hatcher"}> Allen Hatcher
                ,
                %em Topology of cell complexes
                (
                %a{:href => "https://www.math.cornell.edu/~hatcher/AT/ATapp.pdf"}> pdf
                ) in
                %em Algebraic Topology
            %li#HatcherK
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Allen+Hatcher"}> Allen Hatcher
                ,
                %em Vector bundles &amp; K-theory
                (
                %a{:href => "https://www.math.cornell.edu/~hatcher/VBKT/VBpage.html"}> web
                )
            %li#FP
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Rudolf+Fritsch"}> Rudolf Fritsch
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Renzo+A.+Piccinini"} Renzo A. Piccinini
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Cellular structures in topology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511983948"} doi:10.1017/CBO9780511983948
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://epub.ub.uni-muenchen.de/4493/1/4493.pdf"} pdf
            %li#AGP02
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marcelo+Aguilar"}> Marcelo Aguilar
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Samuel+Gitler"} Samuel Gitler
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Carlos+Prieto"} Carlos Prieto
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Algebraic topology from a homotopical viewpoint
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://tocs.ulb.tu-darmstadt.de/106999419.pdf"} toc pdf
          %p Original articles include
          %ul
            %li#Milnor59
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Milnor"}> John Milnor
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On spaces having the homotopy type of a CW-complex
            %li#Milnor57
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Milnor"}> John Milnor
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The geometric realization of a semi-simplicial complex
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 65
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.2307/1969967"} 10.2307/1969967
                %a{:href => "https://pdfs.semanticscholar.org/7cbe/0482ce422d3adcc84be80b5ab3f68520a247.pdf"} Semantic scholar pdf
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/products"} products
            of CW-complexes:
          %ul
            %li#BrookeTaylor17
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Brooke-Taylor"}> Andrew Brooke-Taylor
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Products of CW complexes – the full story
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.helsinki.fi/logic/arctic/2017/Slides/BrookeTaylor_arctic2017.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Brooke-Taylor_ProductsOfCWComplexes.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li#NapierRamachandran
              Terrance Napier, Mohan Ramachandran,
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://www.unige.ch/math/EnsMath/EM_en/"} Elementary Construction of Exhausting Subsolutions of Elliptic Operators
              L’Enseignement Mathématique, t. 50 (2004), p. 367 - 389.
          %p
            An inconclusive discussion
            %a{:href => "http://nforum.mathforge.org/discussion/4135/simplicial-homology/?Focus=33785#Comment_33785"} here
            about what parts of the definition of a CW complex should be
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stuff%2C+structure%2C+property"} properties
            and what parts should be structure.
